External Validation Benchmarks
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

The model was evaluated across 390 external RF signal recordings spanning 7 drone models, 3 flight modes, and 4 RF interference conditions (Clean, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and Both), achieving an overall classification accuracy of 85.13% (332/390).

